[[2047,127,8,"<h3>Functional description</h3><p>The climate control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives\na supply controlled by the ignition (INT/A) at pin 5 of connector\nB from the line protected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of\nthe additional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99.; the same line also\nsupplies all the actuators of the system.</p><p>The direct supply arrives from the battery\n(maxifuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>J/B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B99</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from\n2/99) at pin 10 of connector B through fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of junction\nunit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B1</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The supply for illuminationg the controls\nwith the side lights on reaches pin 2 of connector B from the line\ncoming from the switch for the steering column switch unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>H5</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and\nprotected by fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B11</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F4</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the\nadditional fuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99.</p><p>Pin 14 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is earthed.</p><p>Pin 7 of connector B of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               receives\nthe speedometer signal coming from instrument \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , whilst\nthe outside temperature value is signalled from pin 1 of connector\nA also at instrument \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>E10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The sensor which measures the outside temperature\nis located on the left external rear view mirror \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>P60</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : the\nsensor receives a 5 V supply from pin 13 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               and\nsends the signal to pin 10 of connector A.</p><p>Control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is also connected\nto sensors \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K87</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (lower treated air), \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K88</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (upper treated\nair) and \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K89</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               (passenger compartment air), which receive a\n5 V supply from pin 13 of the connector and send signals to pins\n11, 10, 9 respectively of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>Sensor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>K89</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is fitted with a fan motor\ncontrolled by the ignition so that the temperature reading is not\naffected by the motionless and thus warmer air inside the dashboard.</p><h3>Functional description</h3><p>The air conditioning system is equipped\nwith three activators for recirculation (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N82</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ), air mixing\n(\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N81</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ) and air distribution (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N80</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p><p>The recirculation actuator \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N82</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\ncontrolled by the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from pin 11 of connector\nB, and there is a current feedback at pin 3 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The mixing actuator \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N81</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is controlled\nby the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from pin 6 of connector B, receiving\na supply for controlling the potentiometer from pin 2 of connector\nA and sending a feedback signal to pin 12 of connector B.</p><p>The distribution actuator \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N80</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is\ncontrolled by the control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from pin 16 of connector\nA, receiving a supply for controlling the potentiometer from pin 2\nof connector A and sending a feedback signal to pin 9 of connector\nB.</p><p>The electronic governor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M72</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               operates\nthe fan at different speeds: it receives an input signal from the\ncontrol unit (from pin 3 of connector B) and transforms it into\na variable voltage signal that controls the fan. This voltage control\nis also stabilized, i.e. it is independent of the battery voltage\nvariations.  The governor supply is controlled by the ignition (INT/A)\nfrom fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               up to 2/99 or fuse \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>F6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               of the additional\nfuse box \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B98B</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               from 2/99, is connected to earth and also sends\nthe temperature control signal to pin 4 of connector A of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The fan \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>N85</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is supplied directly\nfrom the battery through the A/C maxifuse line of \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>B6</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              , whilst\nit is controlled at the different speeds for the voltage signal coming\nfrom the electronic governor \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M72</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .</p><p>The control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M70</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               is equipped\nwith a self-test system which can be used by connecting the unit\nto connector \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>R10</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              : it receives signals from pin 8 of connector\nB through the diagnostic line.</p><p>The commands for switching on the heated\nrear windscreen, the LED and the &quot;rapid demist&quot; function\nare transmitted to the integrated services control unit \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <strong>M40</strong>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                               by\npin 1 of connector B and pins 6 and 8 of connector A, respectively.\nIt should be remembered that the climate control control unit only\n&quot;houses&quot; the control button and the LED, but does not\nin any way affect the heated rear windscreen activation logic. (\n\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3233996\">E3030</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              .)</p><p>Pin 7 of connector A controls the activation\nof the compressor (\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              <a href=\"#/3234652\">E6021</a>\n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              \n                              ).</p>"]]